#: src/presenting.md:14
msgid ""
"**`/presenter`** is for you: the current slide, the next slide, speaker "
"notes, a timer, a clock, the slide and step number, blackout, pause, and a "
"live diagnostics panel showing anything the current slide reported. Open it "
"on a second screen."
msgstr ""

#: src/presenting.md:18
msgid ""
"The two stay in sync over a websocket, so they work across two windows, two "
"displays or two devices on the same network. Whichever one you drive, the "
"other follows."
