#: src/presenting.md:37
msgid "Only three iframes"
msgstr ""

#: src/presenting.md:39
msgid ""
"The shell keeps a ring of three frames: previous, current, next. A "
"hundred-slide deck never loads a hundred iframes, and stepping back and "
"forth is instant because the neighbours are already warm."
msgstr ""

#: src/presenting.md:43
msgid ""
"Preloaded frames stay dormant: they do not run reveal animations until they "
"are actually shown. `[server] preload` controls how many neighbours are kept."
msgstr ""

#: src/presenting.md:46
msgid "Presenting from a second machine"
