#: src/presenting.md:52
msgid ""
"deck prints a warning, because that makes the deck readable by anyone on the "
"network. The default binding is `127.0.0.1`."
msgstr ""

#: src/presenting.md:55
msgid "Printing"
msgstr ""

#: src/presenting.md:57
msgid ""
"There is no PDF pipeline in the CLI. Printing is the browser's job, and "
"`/print` is a real page you can inspect first."
msgstr ""

#: src/presenting.md:64
msgid ""
"The page loads every slide in print mode, drives each one to the requested "
"step, waits for fonts, images and any promise a slide registered, and only "
"then enables the **Print** button. `window.print()` is never called for you "
"— the point is that you get to read the preflight report before committing "
"to paper."
msgstr ""

